          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana wa mũndũ, nĩkwĩthĩwa Tile nĩneeneete Yelusaleme, Aa! Nake nũtũlĩtwe ũla waĩ mbingĩlo ya ngo sya andũ; nĩwĩnthyũũĩe; nakwa ngausũwa, nũndũ yu nũtw’ĩkĩthĩtw’e ĩanzo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
