        },
        {
          "text": "Ũũ nĩw’o Mwĩaĩi Yeova ũnũũkũlya Tile: Ithama itikathingithanga ũndũ wa wasya wa kũvalũka kwaku, yĩla ala okite melumaa, yĩla ũaani ũkethĩwa kwaku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
