        },
        {
          "text": "Na makambĩlĩlya ũkũĩĩa, na ũkwĩa, Wanangĩkie ata, we ũla watwĩwe nĩ andũ ala maendaa ũkanganĩ, ndũa ya nguma, ĩla yaĩ na vinya ũkanganĩ, nake na ala make matwĩe kw’o, ala mamatĩsasya onthe ala matwĩe kw’o! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.17"
            ]
